# Agent Note: Documentation Governance Migration

Status: proposed

## Problem

Legacy documentation in this repository suffers from drift, duplicated facts, or mixed historical/current-state prose. This manifest binds every existing doc to an explicit target disposition before `doc-migrate` touches any file.

